    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Coexistence and migration",
      "source_hash": 11631337139120606344,
      "context_hash": 17339067549545005624,
      "translation": "공존과 마이그레이션",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:56.381375Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "iptables and nftables can coexist on a system, but `iptables-nft` (available in modern distros) wraps iptables syntax while using the `nf_tables` backend:",
      "source_hash": 13120066833474949669,
      "context_hash": 8591214215867977024,
      "translation": "iptables와 nftables는 한 시스템에서 공존할 수 있지만, `iptables-nft`(최신 배포판에서 사용 가능)는 `nf_tables` 백엔드를 사용하면서 iptables 문법을 감쌉니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "backend": "백엔드"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:56.381375Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:10/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Debugging and logging",
      "source_hash": 1379354074109951344,
      "context_hash": 10600993993777712876,
      "translation": "디버깅과 로깅",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:56.381376Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Performance comparison",
      "source_hash": 1863840401554524125,
      "context_hash": 2015708422958703168,
      "translation": "성능 비교",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:01:56.381376Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "For simple cases (small rulesets), performance is similar.",
      "source_hash": 13777816647704534811,
      "context_hash": 13790861348228157821,
      "translation": "단순한 경우(작은 규칙 집합)에는 성능이 비슷합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:53.686518Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "For large rulesets:",
      "source_hash": 3267610483550471342,
      "context_hash": 6272632848029337697,
      "translation": "큰 규칙 집합의 경우:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:53.686519Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "**iptables**: O(n) per packet where n = number of rules",
      "source_hash": 4292742018873371860,
      "context_hash": 603709097594229782,
      "translation": "**iptables**: 패킷당 O(n)이며, 여기서 n은 규칙의 수입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:53.686519Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:11/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**nftables with sets**: O(1) for set membership, O(log n) for interval sets",
      "source_hash": 16216399041305558627,
      "context_hash": 8653609293409481242,
      "translation": "**set을 사용하는 nftables**: set 멤버십 확인은 O(1), interval set은 O(log n)입니다",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:08:53.686520Z",
      "issues": []
    },
